# Talent Crafters Career Development

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in values.

```bash
# Inbox that receives checkout / enquiry submissions
CONTACT_EMAIL=sam@talentcrafters.co.za

# WhatsApp number in international format without + (e.g. 27746502580)
NEXT_PUBLIC_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=27746502580

# Optional public site URL for metadata
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Resend — if omitted, orders/enquiries are logged to the server console
RESEND_API_KEY=
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=Talent Crafters <onboarding@resend.dev>

# Vercel Blob — stores uploaded CVs/pictures; if omitted, files are emailed as attachments when Resend is configured
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=

# OpenAI (or AI Gateway) — Canada chat + interview TTS/Whisper/scoring; offline fallbacks if omitted
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# Optional separate secret for candidate interview JWT (falls back to ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET)
# CANDIDATE_SESSION_SECRET=

# Admin dashboard login (/admin/login)
ADMIN_EMAIL=sam@talentcrafters.co.za
ADMIN_PASSWORD=Gospelman
ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string

# Supabase — https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/jwgjsotzauhwkgobywdr
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://jwgjsotzauhwkgobywdr.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# Server-only. Required for admin package/popup/order writes (Project Settings → API → service_role)
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
```
